# 🔑 How to Set Up Your API Key

The backend needs an AI API key to work. You only need ONE of these:

## Option 1: Claude (Anthropic) - You have this!
1. Go to: https://console.anthropic.com/
2. Copy your API key (starts with sk-ant-)
3. Edit backend/.env
4. Change: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-api03-REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_ACTUAL_CLAUDE_API_KEY
5. To: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-YOUR-REAL-KEY-HERE

## Option 2: Gemini (Google) - FREE!
1. Go to: https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey
2. Create API key
3. Edit backend/.env
4. Add: GEMINI_API_KEY=your-key-here

## Option 3: OpenAI
1. Go to: https://platform.openai.com/api-keys
2. Create API key
3. Edit backend/.env
4. Add: OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-proj-your-key-here

## After Adding Your Key:

Start the backend:
cd backend
source venv/bin/activate
python -m uvicorn main:app --reload

You should see:
✅ Anthropic API key configured (or Gemini/OpenAI)
✅ Database initialized
🌐 API running at http://localhost:8000
